{"timestamp":"2026-11-21T22:15:55.061Z","ordinal":36212,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a2002e-29b5-72e0-979a-b8040d45f6e0","call_id":"call_8871b45428b94c67b58c6e9e375c2fb6","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 30.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Refreshing checks status every 30 seconds. Press Ctrl+C to quit.\n\nCodeQL\tpass\t2s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/136998601619\t\nEntire Gates\tpending\t0\thttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/478/changes/nexus-code/422\t\ntest-matrix (22)\tpending\t0\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/44954106037/job/136998275735\t\njavascript-typescript\tpass\t1m22s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/44954106471/job/136998277720\t\ntest-matrix (24)\tpending\t0\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/44954106037/job/136998275691\t\ncloudflare-experiment (22)\tpass\t15s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/44954106037/job/136998275623\t\ncloudflare-experiment (24)\tpass\t29s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/44954106037/job/136998275532\t\nlinux-x86_64\tpending\t0\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/44954106037/job/136998275680\t\nCodeRabbit\tpass\t0\t\tReview skipped: manual review required for this OSS repository\nRefreshing checks status every 30 seconds. Press Ctrl+C to quit.\n\nCodeQL\tpass\t2s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/136998601619\t\nEntire Gates\tpending\t0\thttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/478/changes/nexus-code/422\t\ntest-matrix (22)\tpending\t0\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/44954106037/job/136998275735\t\njavascript-typescript\tpass\t1m22s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/44954106471/job/136998277720\t\ntest-matrix (24)\tpending\t0\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/