{"timestamp":"2026-11-21T22:34:15.623Z","ordinal":36558,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1f54f-2cb2-7201-ad27-acf2d9bbd90e","turn_id":"01a20014-b98e-7f50-9b44-1c38f2a1201a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0393e1fe95dcae93016b021c64ae7087d2bd6d13df0ef32518","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"PR [#684](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/684) is merged to `main` as `a5fa1dca54c176e50f16176fe82454a2dff360e6`.\n\nThe required Node 22, Node 24, and Linux checks passed on the PR head. The separate Entire Gates check failed; repository instructions say it is not a merge gate. Post-merge CI is still running the CLI suite on all three runners, so its result is not yet verified. The local focused tests passed 4/4, and TypeScript compilation passed.\n\nThis PR adds delegation authority regression tests only. The broader v1.3.0 implementation remains in progress; this is not a completion claim."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"content_token_count":160,"started_at_ms":1795300452701,"completed_at_ms":1795300455623}}
