mit c6f00e8f onto origin/main 16eeb6ee; targeted rerun pending because hosted SUITE 41029564419 Node22/24 full suites remain active. Synthetic only, no held-out tasks. On rebased exact candidate c6f00e8f27c0af1a80e7131f8a6f52efa4aa0321 (differs from origin/main only by diagnostics test file), requirements enforcement PASS (123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 mapped exact-RC deferrals), sync-version --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.14 PASS, diff-check PASS. These are source gates, not RC acceptance. Latest post-merge CI41029564419: Node22=SUCCESS, Node24=SUCCESS; Linux package/reproducibility job still in progress, so SUITE held. Independent reviewer re-reviewed rebased exact head c6f00e8f27c0af1a80e7131f8a6f52efa4aa0321 against base 16eeb6ee and reaffirmed ACCEPT; diff SHA-256 d4b51c5450d98343c3cd7e6cd7fe216363541b11f3df97c5bfaa847d88b7d2a3 unchanged; review only, no tests. Branch pushed to origin as v1/eval-t4-overload-diagnostic at c6f00e8f27c0af1a80e7131f8a6f52efa4aa0321. No PR opened yet: main CI41029564419 Linux CLI suite remains active; will rerun focused tests and open PR after SUITE release. Focused exact-current-base rerun completed after main SUITE: 2/2 synthetic cases passed on c6f00e8f27c0af1a80e7131f8a6f52efa4aa0321 with isolated HOME/XDG, CI-built release harness-core, and npm ci. Independent review ACCEPT remains valid. Remote branch is preserved; PR opening waits until RC14 release workflow full suite terminates to prevent overlap.\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-30T09:42:41Z\"\n}\n.git/nexus-claims/docs_assurance_POWER_OF_TEN_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md.released-20261120T081416Z/owner.json\n{\"agent\":\"GPT-6\",\"branch\":\"v1/p10-wp-p10-02-durable-budget\",\"since\":\"2026-11-19T16:31:26Z\",\"pid\":1151293}\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_eval_dataset.mjs.released-20261103T002149Z/owner.json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/v112-integrated-exact\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-integrate