horized budget renewal after exhaustion.\ndocs/assurance/POWER_OF_TEN_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md:53:**Migration / rollback:** New config defaults may shorten formerly unlimited runs; provide an explicit operator override with a hard documented maximum, not Infinity. Keep old records readable. Rollback must not turn persisted exhausted state into zero; older binaries should refuse unsupported budget schema versions. Residual risk: already-running external calls may finish after cancellation or have unknown outcomes.\ndocs/USER_MANUAL.md:348:### Long tasks: bounded automatic continuation\ndocs/USER_MANUAL.md:357:transient failures are spaced with backoff instead of being treated as loops. `--no-continuation` restores the\ndocs/USER_MANUAL.md:390:ignored and `nexus doctor` warns. They work with `--no-continuation`. A project `.env` can only lower them: the\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":798860285}},"started_at_ms":1795301927787,"completed_at_ms":1795301928587}}
